cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Open Health Signals"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pai
    given-names: Rakesh
abstract: >-
  Open-source public-health signal monitor for immune-mediated inflammatory
  diseases and the safety of anti-inflammatory drugs. Weekly FAERS
  disproportionality (PRR and ROR), FDA notices and recalls, ClinicalTrials.gov
  starts, and PubMed counts, published as a static dashboard.
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
keywords:
  - pharmacovigilance
  - FAERS
  - inflammatory disease
  - drug safety
